Populate Jellyfin item genres on Track/Album/Artist parses.

The stock MA jellyfin provider never reads Jellyfin's `Genres` array on
sync, so library genres come only from online metadata enrichers
(theaudiodb, etc.) — which routinely guess wrong. Request the Genres
field on the Items query and copy it through to `metadata.genres`, so
the genre scanner has something accurate to map from.

